[gd_scene load_steps=15 format=3]

; Editor-owned Boardwalk finish layer. The generated buildings remain collision
; and weather backing; these directly selectable pieces carry material scale,
; merchandise and wear whose location is explained by use. Nothing enters Q3,
; the public pier centre, the pavilion turnaround or the sunset-water sector.

